  "notes": "{詰|つ}める has two main meanings: to pack/stuff something, or to close a gap/shorten.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{詰|つ}まる→詰まる：02079_tsumaru⟧ (intransitive, to be packed/clogged)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n⟦{詰|つ}め→詰む：27840_tsumu⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates something is packed or that one is in the process of packing.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{詰|つ}める: to pack into ~\n- ⟦{距離|きょり}→距離：05331_kyori⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{詰|つ}める: to close the distance\n- ⟦{間|ま}→間：00914_aida⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{詰|つ}める: to reduce the gap/interval\n- ⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{詰|つ}める: to hold one's breath\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{詰|つ}め{込|こ}む→詰め込む：04242_tsumekomu⟧: to cram, stuff in",
